    a_very_long_name_is_not_cut_off_at_a_fixed_ceiling  la cause, en un test
    both_columns_scale_with_the_panel                   x2 de place = x2 partout
    the_control_keeps_a_share_of_the_row_not_a_constant
    the_margin_follows_the_panel
    a_panel_can_be_resized_across_a_wide_range          max >= 2,5 x min

